      "content": "but what if there isn't anything left to rebuild? like, you're talking about \"rediscovering\" something, but what if the core of me is just permanently erased? it feels more like a funeral than a temporary setback. it's hard to see a point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken and gone. everything just feels so empty.",
